d_output":"[Family] members:\nThesis v29 (NVDA, asset, focus \"NVIDIA's committed equity investments in ecosystem partners\", FY2027, due 2027-02-28): How much will NVIDIA's equity investment commitments reach at the publication of its FY2027 annual report?\nLadder: rung 1 Strongly bullish: Commitments are below $25 billion. / rung 2 Bullish: Commitments are at least $25 billion and below $50 billion. / rung 3 Neutral: Commitments are at least $50 billion and below $75 billion. / rung 4 Bearish: Commitments are at least $75 billion and below $100 billion. / rung 5 Strongly bearish: Commitments are at least $100 billion.\n\nRelations: none.\nShared quantities, one forecast figure each; on every arithmetic path from an outcome, through rates and multiples too, the first figure of that quantity reached is its forecast: none.\nOutcome keys (population | measure | scope | period), in USD bn, to be used exactly: v29 = NVIDIA | equity investment commitments | company | end of FY2027 (the balance at the end of FY2027, as the FY2027 annual report publishes it).\n\n[Evidence in view for the family, 35 items]\n- e1732 [third_party_view; finance.yahoo.com; original source Bank of America analyst Vivek Arya ; from gnews:d024d71d75661d369798d307 2026-08-12] Bank of America analyst Vivek Arya said NVIDIA had committed to provide $70 billion in equity investments to ecosystem partners; the period covered was not specified.\n    Quote: Nvidia has committed to directly providing $70 billion in equity investments into ecosystem partners, per new research from Bank of America analyst Vivek Arya.\n- e1919 [rumour; Yahoo Finance; original source The Information 2026-08-07; from gnews:e2a48863c597e02d402f1551 2026-08-16] The Information reported on August 7, 2026, that NVIDIA planned to invest up to $3 billion in La\nL 6 F2 '$108.0 billion' none <- 'Revenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%. NVIDIA is not assuming any Data Center compute revenue from China in its outlook.'; F3 '2%' none <- 'Revenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%. NVIDIA is not assuming any Data Center compute revenue from China in its outlook.'; \nL 10 F3 '$108.0 billion' None <- 'Revenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%. NVIDIA is not assuming any Data Center compute revenue from China in its outlook.'; \nL 14 F1 '$177,837' none <- 'Revenue\\n$\\n96,221\\n$\\n46,743\\n$\\n177,837\\n$\\n90,805'; F2 '$108.0 billion' none <- 'Revenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%.'; F4 '$392 billion' none <- \"Wall Street analysts estimate that Nvidia's business could double over the next couple of years, from trailing-12-month revenue of $253 billion to $392 billion this fiscal year, and $554 billion the following year.\"; \nL 16 S5 [('F15', ['v3'], []), ('F17', [], ['v3']), ('F18', [], ['v3'])] [('v3', 'None')]; \nL 20 S6 [('F4', [], ['v29']), ('F5', ['v29'], [])] [('v29', 'None')]; \nL 28 S6 [('F4', [], ['v4']), ('F6', ['v4'], []), ('F8', [], ['v4']), ('F9', ['v4'], []), ('F10', [], ['v4']), ('F11', [], ['v4']), ('F12', [], ['v4']), ('F13', ['v4'], [])] [('v4', 'None')]; S5 [('F4', [], ['v4']), ('F6', ['v4'], []), ('F8', [], ['v4']), ('F9', ['v4'], []), ('F10', [], ['v4']), ('F11', [], ['v4']), ('F12', [], ['v4']), ('F13', ['v4'], [])] [('v4', 'None')]; \nL 30 F2 '$108.0 billion' none <- 'Revenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%. NVIDIA is not assuming any Data Center compute revenue from China in its outlook.'; \nL 32 F4 '$300 billion' more than <- 'Nvidia should generate well over $300 billion of data center revenue in calendar 2026, which is effectively fiscal 2027, and perhaps over $500 billion in fiscal 2028.'; F6 'around $113 billion to $114 billion' around <- 'However, I think Nvidia could report third-quarter revenue of around $113 billion to $114 billion.'; \nL 38 F4 '$392 billion' none <- \"Wall Street analysts estimate that Nvidia's business could double over the next couple of years, from trailing-12-month revenue of $253 billion to $392 billion this fiscal year, and $554 billion the following year.\"; F7 '$177,837' none <- 'Revenue\\n$\\n96,221\\n$\\n46,743\\n$\\n177,837\\n$\\n90,805'; F10 'around $113 billion to $114 billion' around <- 'However, I think Nvidia could report third-quarter revenue of around $113 billion to $114 billion.'; \nL 40 S5 [('F1', [], ['v3']), ('F2', [], ['v3']), ('F3', [], ['v3']), ('F5', [], ['v3']), ('F23', ['v3'], [])] [('v3', 'None')]; \nL 42 F4 '$108.0 billion' none <- 'Revenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%.'; \nL 50 F5 '$105.84 billion–$110.16 billion' none <- 'For the third quarter, Nvidia expects revenue between $105.84 billion and $110.16 billion, representing year-over-year growth of 85.7% to 93.2% from the $57.01 billion reported in the same quarter last year.'; \nL 52 S6 [('F4', [], ['v4']), ('F6', ['v4'], []), ('F8', [], ['v4']), ('F9', [], ['v4']), ('F10', ['v4'], []), ('F11', [], ['v4']), ('F12', ['v4'], []), ('F14', [], ['v4']), ('F15', [], ['v4'])] [('v4', 'None')]; S5 [('F4', [], ['v4']), ('F6', ['v4'], []), ('F8', [], ['v4']), ('F9', [], ['v4']), ('F10', ['v4'], []), ('F11', [], ['v4']), ('F12', ['v4'], []), ('F14', [], ['v4']), ('F15', [], ['v4'])] [('v4', 'None')]; \nL 54 F7 '$108.0 billion' none <- 'Revenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%. NVIDIA is not assuming any Data Center compute revenue from China in its outlook.'; \nL 56 F15 'well over $300 billion' None <- 'Nvidia should generate well over $300 billion of data center revenue in calendar 2026, which is effectively fiscal 2027, and perhaps over $500 billion in fiscal 2028.'; \nL 58 [('id', 'F4'), ('quote_number', 'around $113 billion to $114 billion'), ('value', 113.5), ('low', 113), ('high', 114)]; \nL 60 F3 'around $113 billion to $114 billion' around <- 'However, I think Nvidia could report third-quarter revenue of around $113 billion to $114 billion.'; \nL 62 S6 [('F8', ['v3', 'v35'], []), ('F12', ['v3', 'v3