9: outcome F5 measures NVIDIA | equity investment commitments | company | end of FY2027 (the balance at the end of FY2027, as the FY2027 annual report publishes it), not the question's NVIDIA | equity investment commitments | company | end of FY2027\"]]\nanswers.jsonl 44 2 ['end of FY2027'] []\nanswers.jsonl 68 3 ['end of FY2027 (the balance at the end of FY2027, as the FY2027 annual report publishes it)'] [['S1', 'F4: \"$1 billion\" is not written in the quote of e2207 as a complete number']]\nretries.jsonl 10 1 ['end of FY2027'] []\nretries.jsonl 42 3 ['end of FY2027'] [['S1', 'F5: the quote writes \"as much as\" with \"$10 billion\", but the qualifier is up to'], ['S1', 'F6: \"over $40 billion\" is not written in the quote of e3880 as a complete number']]\npackets.md 078038c12132199937070032e8b24f0c0ffd279f96d4d6aa46a3d42c4ceb4912\nreadings.json e6a0007ae12dbd44ba07e4ca8e92ed2da65e55629e9609094f52ee112db16d76\nreading/readings.json e6a0007ae12dbd44ba07e4ca8e92ed2da65e55629e9609094f52ee112db16d76\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
